(58, 1, 'Rip Line', 'Fires a hook that pulls Valkyr to the target or pulls an enemy to her.'),
(58, 2, 'Warcry', 'Slows nearby enemies and raises attack speed and armor for the squad.'),
(58, 3, 'Paralysis', 'Spends shields in a stunning burst around her.'),
(58, 4, 'Hysteria', 'Fully heals into exalted claws that steal life and make her immune to damage.'),
(59, 1, 'Tesla Nervos', 'Deploys rolling shock mines that stick to enemies.'),
(59, 2, 'Minelayer', 'Cycles tether, flechette, bounce, and overdriver mines.'),
(59, 3, 'Photon Strike', 'Marks a spot, then drops a beam of damage onto it.'),
(59, 4, 'Bastille', 'Suspends enemies in a cage. Holding the cast collapses it into a vortex.'),
(60, 1, 'Shock', 'A chain of electricity that stuns the first targets it jumps to.'),
(60, 2, 'Speed', 'Speeds Volt and nearby allies.'),
(60, 3, 'Electric Shield', 'Raises a shield that blocks fire and adds electricity to shots fired through it.'),
(60, 4, 'Discharge', 'Discharges stored electricity, stunning nearby enemies and damaging them over time.'),
(61, 1, 'Shroud of Dynar', 'Tap to turn invisible and prime a heavy melee buff. Hold for extra parkour speed.'),
(61, 2, 'Fangs of Raksh', 'Tap to stack random statuses on a target. Hold for status resistance.'),
(61, 3, 'Lycath''s Hunt', 'Tap so melee kills drop health and headshot kills drop energy. Hold to ease heavy attacks.'),
(61, 4, 'Ulfrun''s Descent', 'Tap to drop onto all fours and spend charges on locking lunges. Hold so the wolf can die in her place.'),
(62, 1, 'Reservoirs', 'Places motes that grant health, haste, or a shock aura. Holding the cast chooses the mote.'),
(62, 2, 'Wil-O-Wisp', 'Sends a clone that distracts enemies. Casting again teleports Wisp to it.'),
(62, 3, 'Breach Surge', 'Blinds enemies. Shooting them releases homing sparks.'),
(62, 4, 'Sol Gate', 'Opens a sunbeam that burns in a line and grows stronger the longer it fires.'),
(63, 1, 'Celestial Twin', 'Summons a clone that copies his weapon fire.'),
(63, 2, 'Cloud Walker', 'Becomes a cloud that stuns enemies he passes through and heals a little.'),
(63, 3, 'Defy', 'Stuns nearby foes, then turns the damage he took into armor.'),
(63, 4, 'Primal Fury', 'Draws an exalted staff with long reach and combo-building swings.'),
(64, 1, 'Xata''s Whisper', 'Adds void damage to weapons.'),
(64, 2, 'Grasp of Lohk', 'Steals enemy weapons and sets them orbiting as turrets.'),
(64, 3, 'The Lost', 'Cycles three lost spells: a gaze that strips defenses, an accuse that turns foes, and a deny that disarms.'),
(64, 4, 'The Vast Untime', 'Breaks Xaku apart, freezing nearby enemies in time and strengthening the stolen guns.'),
(65, 1, 'Sea Snares', 'Leaves bubbles that trap enemies and float them up.'),
(65, 2, 'Merulina', 'Summons a board that Yareli rides, gaining protection while she stays on it.'),
(65, 3, 'Aquablades', 'Orbits blades of water that cut nearby enemies.'),
(65, 4, 'Riptide', 'Pulls enemies into a crushing whirlpool.'),
(66, 1, 'Tail Wind', 'Dashes on the wind. Aiming down dives, and aiming up launches her.'),
(66, 2, 'Airburst', 'Fires a burst that pulls enemies in, or hold to push them out.'),
(66, 3, 'Turbulence', 'A wind shield that deflects bullets.'),
(66, 4, 'Tornado', 'Calls tornadoes that pick enemies up and carry the element of damage they take.'),
(67, 1, 'Neote', 'Lunges with her ice blade, inflicting cold and puncture and building Ice.'),
(67, 2, 'Naraemagi', 'Pulls cold off nearby enemies to refill shields, turning overflow into overguard.'),
(67, 3, 'Hakchum', 'Leaps, then dives onto a spot that chills enemies and makes them take more cold damage.'),
